## use curl to check MetaData

http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data

```sh
TOKEN=$(curl -X PUT "http://169.254.169.254/latest/api/token" \ -H "X-aws-ec2-metadata-token-ttl-seconds: 21600" --silent) echo $TOKEN
```

```sh
curl -H "X-aws-ec2-metadata-token: $TOKEN" \ http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/
```
